                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.84in;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">蝉鸣盛夏，骊歌奏响。6 月 23 日，绍兴一中 2025 届高三学生毕业典礼顺利举行。校领导班子、全体高三师生、家长代表以及后勤工作人员代表参加了本次典礼。  </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">                         </span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>【校领导殷切期许】</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">首先，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市教育局党委副书记、校党委书记丁初效致辞，临别之际，他向毕业生们表达未来期许。一是“阅己”，要认识自我、认清自我，正确看待高考、真实看待社会和客观看待挫折。二是“越己”，要挑战自我、超越自我，他从“赢”和“输”两个字的汉字构造角度解读了“树立危机意识”“提升表达能力”“强化时间观念”“养成总结反思的思维习惯”“保持心态阳光”等优秀品质对成就精彩人生的重要性。三是“悦己”，要涵养自我、悦纳自我，要懂得感恩，学会宽恕，乐于施善，保持心态平和。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">                  </span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>【师长心声诉深情，学子代表话青春】</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教师代表孙舒曼和毕业生们分享了她的人生感悟。一是“永远真实，永远笃定”。知人者智，自知者明，要明确自己的目标，然后孜孜以求。二是“拥有当下，拥有未来”。面对成长过程中的挫折与不如意，要始终相信美好的果实成于汗水的浇灌。三是“提升认知，提升价值”。要做时代的变量，突破认知边界，面对新时代提升新价值。</span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">    </span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">306班金凡博妈妈代表家长们发言，她首先感谢一中老师们的陪伴与关怀，滋养着学生的成长；其次，祝贺并肩作战的 “后浪” 们，要珍惜纯粹又热血的同学情，并致敬用心护航的家长们，一起做 “后快乐父母”，放手让孩子去单飞吧。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生代表</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">308班冯敏瑶同学回顾了高中三年的酸甜苦辣，那些一起奋斗的日子、一起克服的困难、一起收获的喜悦，都成为了青春最珍贵的回忆。“进入大学后，我们将承一中求真精神，深耕专业领域，在学术上发光发热；也将奉献社会，感受生命价值。我们将怀母校人文底蕴，在AI快速迭代的背景下寻觅不被技术定义的人生。”冯同学的发言，道出了全体毕业生的心声。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 2.20in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>【证书颁发定格荣光】</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校党委副书记、校长蒋明为各班学生代表颁发毕业证书并合影留念。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">                 </span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>【感恩母校情意浓，校长寄语启新程】</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">    桃李不言恩长在，培育之恩，乌鸟反哺。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">311班朱浩川代表全体高三学生向学校赠送纪念礼品。</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">随后主持人即兴采访校长蒋明，蒋校长感谢大家的一片深情</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，表示学校会遵照大家的意愿，以毕业纪念树的形式，将大家的爱心种植于校园，见证大家的一路成长，另外，蒋校长还</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">嘱咐大家要</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">牢记一中“求真博雅”的校训校风，不辱作为一中人“求真知、觅真理、做真人”的光荣使命</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；同时</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">希望大家常回家看看，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">不管你们走得多远，飞得多高，老师永远是你们的后盾，一中永远是你们的家！</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">    各班学生代表向全体高三班主任、任课老师及学校后勤工作人员献上鲜花，感谢他们三年里一路的默默守护与陪伴。  </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 1.46in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>【青春舞台绽放风采，祝福MV温暖心田】</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同学们用精心编排的节目，将三年的情谊与不舍化作一个个精彩瞬间，报告厅里掌声、欢呼声此起彼伏，为这场青春的告别增添了最绚烂的色彩。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">随后播放的毕业祝福 MV，汇聚了老师们的真挚祝福。一句句温暖的话语、一张张灿烂的笑脸，让毕业生们感受到了关爱与支持。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">                        </span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>【校歌合唱荡回响】</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">典礼在全体师生合唱《绍兴一中校歌》的歌声中缓缓落下帷幕。“蕺山风高，姚江流长；承前启后，努力精进……”毕业不是终点，前方路还很长。愿有岁月可回首，且以今朝共叙怀。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">                           </span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>【毕业快乐！】</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">云程发轫 万里可期。相信绍兴一中 2025 届的毕业生们，将带着母校的祝福与期望，怀揣梦想，勇敢地奔赴人生的下一站，在更广阔的天地间书写属于自己的辉煌篇章！</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852155262.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852155262.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852117453.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852117453.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852156586.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852156586.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852154712.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852154712.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852153541.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852153541.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852170070.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852170070.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852177248.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852177248.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852161929.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852161929.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852176007.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852176007.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852173258.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852173258.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852218859.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852218859.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852235289.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852235289.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852238206.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852238206.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852368883.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852368883.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852276467.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852276467.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852320063.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852320063.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852292633.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852292633.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852325632.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852325632.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/6/202506260852379972.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202506260852379972.jpg" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
